      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Ymir era el padre de todos los gigantes de hielo.",
          "en": "Ymir was the father of all the frost giants."
        },
        {
          "es": "Mientras dormía, de su sudor nacieron más gigantes, un hombre y una mujer debajo de su brazo.",
          "en": "While he slept, more giants were born from his sweat, a man and a woman under his arm."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así el mundo empezó a llenarse de gigantes, salvajes y crueles.",
          "en": "And so the world began to fill with giants, wild and cruel."
        }
